        "text": "New JukaHub v0.4 is built from scratch and is 10x smaller than v0.3, is 3 seconds faster in startup, features more modular design, removes dependency on old players and instead uses a custom built from scratch player. There are still many features missing, but feel free to send me a message...Chat is back online, and videos play, tools someone work. FTP server has been added, file manager seems to be working...PDF reader and image viewer are built-in",
